        "TileImage": "$($repository 456abdb7-86a8-43c7-8461-f0fca8f45659).Image",
        "Description": "Great christmast 47. Tonight in Paris there is a free and open Christmas party. However, we have been informed of a terrorist attack during the party. You have about 30 minutes to assassinate all three targets before they can detonate the bombs. The first target of the night is Chappell Francoeur. The second target is Chappell&apos;s good friend Lothair Daoust. In the attic is the bomb supervisor and his representative Nico Gros, who has taken on the guise of a guard. Good luck 47. Great hunting.",
